{
  "name": "Good Sailor",
  "type": "skill",
  "system": {
    "description": "<p>You may use this skill if your subclass is Fisherman, Pirate, or Admiral.</p>\n<p>You gain the [Aquatic] tag. If the target of your attack has the [Aquatic] tag, you gain +10 to damage roll of that attack.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>(CR 11): &nbsp;Increase the damage by +5.<br>(CR 21): &nbsp;Increase the damage by an additional +5.</p>\n<hr>\n<p>You are an expert swimmer, and you are also good at fighting in water, such as seas and rivers. The water is your fishing ground.</p>",
